meta {
  name: Update User
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/update-user/EMP-123
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Updated Name",
    "email": "updated@example.com",
    "phone": "9876543210",
    "role": "RM",
    "dept": "Software",
    "designation": "Senior Developer",
    "location": "Bangalore",
    "rmEmpId": "GN-01",
    "hodEmpId": "GN-1042",
    "newEmpId": "EMP-123"
  }
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.status === 200) {
    console.log("✅ User updated:", res.body.user?.empId, "|", res.body.user?.name, "| Role:", res.body.user?.role);
  } else if (res.status === 403) {
    console.log("❌", res.body.error || "Access denied");
  } else {
    console.log("❌", res.body.error);
  }
}

docs {
  # Update User

  Allows Admin, Management, HR DeptHOD, or SuperUser to update an existing user's profile.

  ## URL Parameter
  Replace `EMP-123` with the target user's **current** `empId`.

  ## Changing the Employee ID
  Send `newEmpId` with a different value to rename the user's `empId`.
  - **Only SuperUser or HR DeptHOD** may do this — anyone else gets **403**.
  - Leave `newEmpId` out (or equal to the current ID) to keep the ID unchanged.
  - Everything that references the old ID moves to the new one in a single transaction:
    requests, chat messages, roles, login logs, sessions, read receipts, food
    subscriptions/cancellations/manual entries, push & FCM tokens, other users' `rmEmpId`/`hodEmpId`,
    and requests' `assignedPersonEmpId` / `ccEmpIds` lists.
  - The user is force-logged-out on mobile and must log in again with the new ID.
  - `GN-01` and `GN-02` cannot be renamed (Management routing is hard-coded to them).

  ## Body fields (all optional — only send fields to change)
  | Field       | Type   | Description                              |
  |-------------|--------|------------------------------------------|
  | newEmpId    | string | New Employee ID — SuperUser / HR DeptHOD only |
  | name        | string | Full display name                        |
  | email       | string | Email address (stored lowercase)         |
  | phone       | string | Phone number                             |
  | role        | string | One of: Requestor, RM, HOD, DeptHOD, Management, Admin, SuperUser, Intern, ViewCloseTicket |
  | dept        | string | Department name                          |
  | designation | string | Job title                                |
  | location    | string | Office location                          |
  | rmEmpId     | string | Reporting manager's empId (or null)      |
  | hodEmpId    | string | HOD's empId (or null)                    |

  ## Errors
  - **400** — `newEmpId` already used by another user, `GN-01`/`GN-02` rename attempt, or RM/HOD ID not found
  - **403** — caller does not have admin-like access, or non-SuperUser/HR trying to change `newEmpId`
  - **404** — empId not found in database
}
